---
import BlogPost from '../../layouts/BlogPost.astro';

// Figures match the item pages on this site.
const drinks = [
  { name: 'Chocolate shake', href: '/items/chocolate-shake', s: '$3.49 · ~710 cal', m: '$4.29 · ~950 cal', l: '$4.99 · ~1,270 cal' },
  { name: 'MooLatté (mocha)', href: '/items/moolatte', s: '$4.29 · ~490 cal', m: '$4.99 · ~660 cal', l: '$5.49 · ~870 cal' },
  { name: 'Misty Slush', href: '/items/misty-slush', s: '$2.39 · ~150 cal', m: '$2.89 · ~200 cal', l: '$3.29 · ~260 cal' },
  { name: 'Fruit smoothie', href: '/items/fruit-smoothies', s: '$3.99 · ~220 cal', m: '$4.49 · ~300 cal', l: '$4.99 · ~390 cal' },
  { name: 'Orange Julius', href: '/items/orange-julius', s: '$3.99 · ~210 cal', m: '$4.49 · ~280 cal', l: '—' },
];

const faqs = [
  { q: 'What is the difference between a shake and a malt at Dairy Queen?', a: 'A malt is a shake with malted milk powder blended in. It tastes a little nutty and toasty, like a malted milk ball. Many stores charge the same or a little more for a malt.' },
  { q: 'Does a DQ MooLatté have caffeine?', a: 'Yes. A MooLatté is made with coffee, so it contains caffeine. The amount depends on size; check Dairy Queen’s nutrition information for exact figures.' },
  { q: 'Is the Misty Slush dairy-free?', a: 'Most Misty Slush flavors are made without dairy. A Misty Freeze, which blends in soft serve, does contain milk.' },
  { q: 'How much is a shake at Dairy Queen?', a: 'A small shake typically costs about $3.49, a medium about $4.29 and a large about $4.99. Prices vary by location.' },
];
---
<BlogPost
  title="Dairy Queen Shakes & MooLatté Guide (2026)"
  description="Dairy Queen shakes, malts, MooLattés and Misty Slush: flavors, sizes, typical prices and calories, plus which drink to pick."
  h1="Dairy Queen Shakes, Malts and MooLatté: Prices and Guide"
  crumb="DQ Shakes & MooLatté"
  eyebrow="Drinks at DQ"
  image="/Images/moolatte.webp"
  imageAlt="Dairy Queen MooLatté frozen coffee drink with whipped cream"
  datePublished="2026-07-22"
  faqs={faqs}
>
  <p class="lead"><strong>A small Dairy Queen shake costs about $3.49, and a small MooLatté frozen coffee about $4.29.</strong> Shakes come in chocolate, vanilla, strawberry and more, and any shake can be made as a malt. For something lighter, a small Misty Slush is about 150 calories. Here is how the DQ drinks compare.</p>

  <h2 id="prices">DQ drink prices and calories</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="size-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Drink</th><th>Small</th><th>Medium</th><th>Large</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>{drinks.map((d) => <tr><td><strong><a href={d.href}>{d.name}</a></strong></td><td>{d.s}</td><td>{d.m}</td><td>{d.l}</td></tr>)}</tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 id="shake-vs-malt">Shake or malt?</h2>
  <p>A DQ shake is soft serve blended with milk and flavor syrup. A malt adds malted milk powder, which gives it a toasty, slightly nutty taste. If you like malted milk balls, order the malt. Malt powder contains wheat and barley, so skip it if you avoid gluten.</p>

  <h2 id="moolatte">What is a MooLatté?</h2>
  <p>The <a href="/items/moolatte">MooLatté</a> is DQ’s blended frozen coffee, made with coffee and soft serve and topped with whipped cream. Mocha and caramel are the common flavors. It is sweeter and thicker than a coffeehouse iced coffee and has caffeine, so it is more of a dessert than a morning coffee.</p>

  <h2 id="lighter">Lighter drinks</h2>
  <p>The <a href="/items/misty-slush">Misty Slush</a> is the lightest frozen drink and has no fat. <a href="/items/fruit-smoothies">Fruit smoothies</a> and the <a href="/items/orange-julius">Orange Julius</a> (at locations that sell it) are also much lighter than shakes. Blend a Misty with soft serve and you get a Misty Freeze, one of the items on our <a href="/blog/dairy-queen-secret-menu">DQ secret menu</a> list.</p>

  <h2 id="which-to-pick">Which DQ drink should you get?</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Classic dessert:</strong> a <a href="/items/chocolate-shake">chocolate shake</a> or malt.</li>
    <li><strong>Coffee fix:</strong> a MooLatté.</li>
    <li><strong>Hot day, lighter option:</strong> a Misty Slush.</li>
    <li><strong>Want something to eat with a spoon instead?</strong> See the <a href="/categories/blizzard-treats">Blizzard menu</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>Every drink and size is on our <a href="/categories/drinks">DQ drinks menu</a>.</p>
</BlogPost>
